<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>RIFA – GANA $50.000 GRATIS</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=DM+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root {
  --gold: #FFD000;
  --gold2: #FF9800;
  --green: #00E676;
  --red: #FF3D3D;
  --dark: #080808;
  --card: #111111;
  --card2: #181818;
  --border: #252525;
  --border2: #333;
  --text: #F0F0F0;
  --muted: #666;
  --muted2: #999;
}
* { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body {
  background: var(--dark);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  overflow-x: hidden;
  min-height: 100vh;
}

/* ── HERO ── */
.hero {
  position: relative;
  padding: 52px 24px 48px;
  text-align: center;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.hero::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: -80px; left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  width: 700px; height: 600px;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(255,208,0,0.09) 0%, transparent 65%);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.hero-eyebrow {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  background: rgba(255,208,0,0.1);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,208,0,0.25);
  border-radius: 100px;
  padding: 6px 16px;
  font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--gold);
  letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  margin-bottom: 28px;
}
.hero h1 {
  font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
  font-size: clamp(72px, 18vw, 148px);
  line-height: 0.88;
  color: var(--gold);
  text-shadow: 0 0 80px rgba(255,208,0,0.25);
  letter-spacing: -2px;
  position: relative;
}
.hero h1 .sub {
  display: block;
  font-size: 28%;
  color: var(--text);
  letter-spacing: 6px;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.free-pill {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--green);
  color: #000;
  font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
  font-size: 22px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  padding: 6px 22px;
  border-radius: 100px;
  margin-top: 18px;
}
.hero-meta {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 24px;
  margin-top: 28px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.hero-meta-item {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
  font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted2);
}
.hero-meta-item strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }

/* ── STEPS (how to enter) ── */
.steps-wrap {
  padding: 0 16px 56px;
  max-width: 700px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.section-label {
  font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 4px;
  color: var(--muted);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.steps-cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
  gap: 12px;
}
.step {
  background: var(--card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 22px 16px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: border-color 0.2s;
}
.step:hover { border-color: var(--border2); }
.step-n {
  font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
  font-size: 56px;
  color: var(--border);
  line-height: 1;
  position: absolute;
  top: 8px; right: 12px;
}
.step-icon { font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.step h3 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 5px; }
.step p { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted2); line-height: 1.5; }
.step a { color: var(--gold); text-decoration: none; }
.step a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

/* ── LIVE NUMBERS GRID ── */
.numbers-wrap {
  padding: 0 16px 56px;
  max-width: 700px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.numbers-header {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: flex-end;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
}
.numbers-title {
  font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
  font-size: 38px;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
}
.live-dot {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
  font-size: 11px; color: var(--green);
  font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
}
.live-dot::before {
  content: '';
  width: 7px; height: 7px;
  background: var(--green);
  border-radius: 50%;
  animation: blink 1.4s infinite;
}
@keyframes blink { 0%,100%{opacity:1} 50%{opacity:0.2} }

.counter-row {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.stat-box {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 100px;
  background: var(--card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 16px;
  text-align: center;
}
.stat-box .big {
  font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
  font-size: 48px;
  line-height: 1;
}
.stat-box .big.taken-color { color: var(--red); }
.stat-box .big.free-color { color: var(--green); }
.stat-box .big.total-color { color: var(--gold); }
.stat-box .lbl {
  font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-top: 2px;
}
.progress-track {
  background: var(--border);
  border-radius: 4px;
  height: 6px;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.progress-fill {
  height: 100%;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold), var(--red));
  border-radius: 4px;
  transition: width 1s ease;
}
.progress-meta {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

/* number chips */
.range-filter {
  display: flex;
  gap: 8px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.range-btn {
  background: var(--card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  color: var(--muted2);
  font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 11px;
  padding: 6px 12px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.15s;
}
.range-btn.active, .range-btn:hover {
  border-color: var(--gold);
  color: var(--gold);
  background: rgba(255,208,0,0.05);
}
.grid-legend {
  display: flex;
  gap: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
  color: var(--muted);
}
.grid-legend span { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }
.dot { width:8px; height:8px; border-radius: 50%; }
.dot.g { background: var(--green); }
.dot.r { background: #333; }

.num-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(56px, 1fr));
  gap: 5px;
}
.n-chip {
  font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 11px;
  padding: 7px 4px;
  border-radius: 5px;
  border: 1px solid;
  text-align: center;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.12s;
  user-select: none;
}
.n-chip.free {
  border-color: rgba(0,230,118,0.35);
  color: var(--green);
  background: rgba(0,230,118,0.04);
}
.n-chip.free:hover {
  background: rgba(0,230,118,0.12);
  border-color: var(--green);
  transform: scale(1.05);
}
.n-chip.free.selected {
  background: var(--green);
  color: #000;
  font-weight: 700;
}
.n-chip.taken {
  border-color: #222;
  color: #333;
  cursor: not-allowed;
  text-decoration: line-through;
}
.grid-loading {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 40px;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 12px;
}

/* ── FORM ── */
.form-wrap {
  padding: 0 16px 80px;
  max-width: 700px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.form-card {
  background: var(--card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 36px 28px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.form-card::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
  height: 2px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold), transparent);
}
.form-title {
  font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
  font-size: 40px;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.form-subtitle {
  color: var(--muted2);
  font-size: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 28px;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.selected-num-display {
  background: rgba(255,208,0,0.07);
  border: 1px dashed rgba(255,208,0,0.4);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 16px;
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
  display: none;
}
.selected-num-display.visible { display: block; }
.selected-num-display .sn-label {
  font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.selected-num-display .sn-num {
  font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
  font-size: 52px;
  color: var(--gold);
  letter-spacing: 6px;
  line-height: 1;
}

.field { margin-bottom: 18px; }
.field label {
  display: block;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  margin-bottom: 7px;
  color: var(--muted2);
}
.field label span { color: var(--gold); margin-left: 2px; }
.field input, .field select {
  width: 100%;
  background: var(--card2);
  border: 1px solid var(--border2);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  font-size: 15px;
  padding: 13px 16px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  outline: none;
  transition: border-color 0.2s;
  -webkit-appearance: none;
}
.field input:focus, .field select:focus {
  border-color: var(--gold);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255,208,0,0.08);
}
.field input::placeholder { color: var(--muted); }
.field input.error { border-color: var(--red); }

/* file upload */
.file-upload-area {
  border: 2px dashed var(--border2);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 32px 16px;
  text-align: center;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s;
  position: relative;
}
.file-upload-area:hover, .file-upload-area.dragover {
  border-color: var(--gold);
  background: rgba(255,208,0,0.03);
}
.file-upload-area input[type=file] {
  position: absolute; inset: 0;
  opacity: 0; cursor: pointer;
  width: 100%; height: 100%;
}
.upload-icon { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.upload-text { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted2); }
.upload-sub { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; }
.file-preview {
  margin-top: 12px;
  display: none;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  background: rgba(0,230,118,0.07);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,230,118,0.2);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 10px 14px;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--green);
}
.file-preview.visible { display: flex; }
.file-preview img {
  width: 48px; height: 48px;
  object-fit: cover;
  border-radius: 4px;
}

/* row */
.field-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 14px;
}
@media(max-width:480px){ .field-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

.btn-submit {
  width: 100%;
  background: var(--gold);
  color: #000;
  border: none;
  font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
  font-size: 26px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  padding: 18px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  cursor: pointer;
  margin-top: 8px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
}
.btn-submit:hover {
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(255,208,0,0.25);
}
.btn-submit:disabled {
  opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; transform: none;
}
.btn-submit .spinner {
  display: none;
  width: 20px; height: 20px;
  border: 2px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  border-top-color: #000;
  border-radius: 50%;
  animation: spin 0.7s linear infinite;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
@keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
.form-note {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--muted);
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: 14px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
.form-error {
  background: rgba(255,61,61,0.1);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,61,61,0.3);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 12px 16px;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--red);
  margin-top: 14px;
  display: none;
}

/* ── SUCCESS ── */
.success-screen {
  display: none;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 48px 24px;
}
.success-screen.visible { display: block; }
.success-icon { font-size: 72px; margin-bottom: 16px; animation: bounce 0.5s ease; }
@keyframes bounce { 0%{transform:scale(0)} 70%{transform:scale(1.15)} 100%{transform:scale(1)} }
.success-screen h2 {
  font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
  font-size: 52px;
  color: var(--green);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.success-num-box {
  display: inline-block;
  background: rgba(0,230,118,0.07);
  border: 2px dashed rgba(0,230,118,0.4);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 20px 40px;
  margin: 16px 0 24px;
}
.success-num-box .label {
  font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
}
.success-num-box .num {
  font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
  font-size: 64px;
  color: var(--green);
  letter-spacing: 8px;
  line-height: 1;
}
.success-screen p { color: var(--muted2); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; }
.success-screen strong { color: var(--text); }

/* ── FOOTER ── */
footer {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 32px 20px;
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.9;
}
footer strong { color: var(--muted2); }

/* ── TOAST ── */
.toast {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: 24px; left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(80px);
  background: var(--card2);
  border: 1px solid var(--border2);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 12px 20px;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 600;
  z-index: 200;
  transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.toast.show { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }
.toast.green { border-color: var(--green); color: var(--green); }
.toast.red { border-color: var(--red); color: var(--red); }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-eyebrow">🎲 LOTERÍA DE MEDELLÍN · 31 MAYO · 1.000 NÚMEROS</div>
  <h1>
    <span class="sub">GANA</span>
    $50.000
  </h1>
  <div class="free-pill">✅ PARTICIPACIÓN 100% GRATIS</div>
  <div class="hero-meta">
    <div class="hero-meta-item">📱 <strong>Descarga la app</strong></div>
    <div class="hero-meta-item">📸 <strong>Envía screenshot</strong></div>
    <div class="hero-meta-item">🎯 <strong>Elige tu número</strong></div>
    <div class="hero-meta-item">🏆 <strong>¡Gana!</strong></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- HOW TO ENTER -->
<section class="steps-wrap">
  <div class="section-label">// CÓMO PARTICIPAR — ES GRATIS</div>
  <div class="steps-cards">
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-n">01</div>
      <div class="step-icon">📱</div>
      <h3>Descarga la app</h3>
      <p>Entra a <a href="https://webcomics.app/jIj0" target="_blank">webcomics.app/jIj0</a> y descarga la aplicación</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-n">02</div>
      <div class="step-icon">📧</div>
      <h3>Haz login</h3>
      <p>Crea tu cuenta con correo electrónico en la app</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-n">03</div>
      <div class="step-icon">📸</div>
      <h3>Toma captura</h3>
      <p>Screenshot de tu perfil en la app (como el ejemplo de abajo)</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-n">04</div>
      <div class="step-icon">🎯</div>
      <h3>Elige número</h3>
      <p>Selecciona un número libre y llena el formulario</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- Screenshot example -->
  <div style="margin-top:20px; background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:12px; padding:20px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
    <div style="font-size:28px">📋</div>
    <div>
      <div style="font-size:13px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:4px;">Ejemplo de captura válida</div>
      <div style="font-size:12px; color:var(--muted2); line-height:1.5;">Tu screenshot debe mostrar tu <strong style="color:var(--text)">nombre de usuario y perfil</strong> dentro de la app Webcomics — igual a como aparece en la imagen que te mostraron.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- LIVE NUMBERS -->
<section class="numbers-wrap">
  <div class="numbers-header">
    <div class="numbers-title">NÚMEROS EN VIVO</div>
    <div class="live-dot" id="live-status">CARGANDO...</div>
  </div>

  <div class="counter-row">
    <div class="stat-box"><div class="big taken-color" id="cnt-taken">—</div><div class="lbl">TOMADOS</div></div>
    <div class="stat-box"><div class="big free-color" id="cnt-free">—</div><div class="lbl">LIBRES</div></div>
    <div class="stat-box"><div class="big total-color">1000</div><div class="lbl">TOTAL</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" id="prog" style="width:0%"></div></div>
  <div class="progress-meta"><span>0</span><span id="prog-pct">0% tomado</span><span>1000</span></div>

  <div class="range-filter" id="range-filter">
    <button class="range-btn active" data-range="0">Todos</button>
    <button class="range-btn" data-range="1">0001–0100</button>
    <button class="range-btn" data-range="2">0101–0200</button>
    <button class="range-btn" data-range="3">0201–0300</button>
    <button class="range-btn" data-range="4">0301–0400</button>
    <button class="range-btn" data-range="5">0401–0500</button>
    <button class="range-btn" data-range="6">0501–0600</button>
    <button class="range-btn" data-range="7">0601–0700</button>
    <button class="range-btn" data-range="8">0701–0800</button>
    <button class="range-btn" data-range="9">0801–0900</button>
    <button class="range-btn" data-range="10">0901–1000</button>
  </div>
  <div class="grid-legend">
    <span><div class="dot g"></div> Libre — click para elegir</span>
    <span><div class="dot r"></div> Tomado</span>
  </div>
  <div class="num-grid" id="num-grid">
    <div class="grid-loading">⟳ Cargando números...</div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FORM -->
<section class="form-wrap" id="form-section">
  <div class="form-card" id="form-card">
    <div class="form-title">REGISTRATE</div>
    <div class="form-subtitle">Llena el formulario con tus datos y sube tu captura de pantalla de la app. Confirmaremos tu número en minutos.</div>

    <div class="selected-num-display" id="sel-display">
      <div class="sn-label">NÚMERO SELECCIONADO</div>
      <div class="sn-num" id="sel-num-big">—</div>
    </div>

    <div class="field-row">
      <div class="field">
        <label>Nombre completo <span>*</span></label>
        <input type="text" id="f-name" placeholder="Tu nombre" autocomplete="name">
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label>WhatsApp <span>*</span></label>
        <input type="tel" id="f-wa" placeholder="+57 300 000 0000" autocomplete="tel">
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="field-row">
      <div class="field">
        <label>Correo (el que usaste en la app) <span>*</span></label>
        <input type="email" id="f-email" placeholder="correo@ejemplo.com" autocomplete="email">
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label>País <span>*</span></label>
        <select id="f-pais">
          <option value="">Selecciona...</option>
          <option>Colombia</option>
          <option>Venezuela</option>
          <option>Ecuador</option>
          <option>Perú</option>
          <option>México</option>
          <option>Estados Unidos</option>
          <option>Otro</option>
        </select>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="field">
      <label>Número que deseas (1–1000) <span>*</span></label>
      <input type="number" id="f-num" min="1" max="1000" placeholder="Ej: 345" oninput="syncNumFromInput(this.value)">
    </div>

    <div class="field">
      <label>Screenshot de tu perfil en la app <span>*</span></label>
      <div class="file-upload-area" id="upload-area">
        <input type="file" id="f-file" accept="image/*" onchange="handleFile(this)">
        <div class="upload-icon">📱</div>
        <div class="upload-text">Toca aquí para subir tu captura</div>
        <div class="upload-sub">JPG, PNG · máx 5MB</div>
      </div>
      <div class="file-preview" id="file-preview">
        <img id="file-thumb" src="" alt="preview">
        <span id="file-name">archivo.jpg</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="field">
      <label>¿Quién te invitó? (opcional)</label>
      <input type="text" id="f-ref" placeholder="Nombre de quien te compartió el link">
    </div>

    <button class="btn-submit" id="btn-submit" onclick="submitForm()">
      <span id="btn-text">🎯 CONFIRMAR MI NÚMERO</span>
      <div class="spinner" id="btn-spinner"></div>
    </button>

    <div class="form-error" id="form-error"></div>

    <p class="form-note">
      Al enviar confirmas que descargaste la app usando el link oficial.<br>
 